                   │    Kafka               │
                   └─────────────┘
The important HLD problem appears when you have multiple instances.
Suppose:

User A
  |
Load Balancer
  |
Instance 1

But the event arrives at:

Kafka
  |
Instance 2

Instance 1 is waiting for the notification.
Instance 2 received it.

How does Instance 1 know?
You need shared infrastructure such as:
	• Kafka 
	• Redis Pub/Sub 
	• database 
	• distributed event bus 

